{"displayStem":"당뇨병과 만성콩팥병이 있는 68세 남자가 걸을 때 종아리가 아프다고 왔다. 발목 동맥이 커프에 잘 눌리지 않았고 반복 검사에서도 같은 양상이었다. 이번 환자의 점들은 한 사람의 반복 검사이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>동일 방식으로 검사한 관찰</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"동일 방식으로 검사한 관찰。ABI (무차원)、TBI (무차원)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">TBI (무차원)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.3</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.6</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.9</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">1.2</text><circle cx=\"300.4\" cy=\"118.79999999999998\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"110.1\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"337.8\" cy=\"114.44999999999999\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"353.2\" cy=\"102.85000000000001\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"234.4\" cy=\"166.65\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"212.4\" cy=\"184.05\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"269.6\" cy=\"152.14999999999998\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"370.8\" cy=\"108.65\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">비교 대상자</text><rect x=\"429.20000000000005\" y=\"186.65\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"435.8\" y=\"183.75\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"424.8\" y=\"188.10000000000002\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"342\" y=\"306\">이번 환자</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ABI (무차원)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>추가 검사</th><th>결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>상완 수축기압</td><td>130mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>발가락 수축기압</td><td>35~38mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>도플러 판독</td><td>원위부 단상성 파형</td></tr><tr><td>측정 환경</td><td>충분히 보온, 센서 이상 없음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}